      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present two siblings with a partial deletion of chromosome 1p31.1 involving only the neuronal growth regulator 1 (NEGR1) gene. The siblings had a history of neuropsychiatric and behavioral problems, learning difficulties, hypotonia, mild aortic root dilatation, hypermobility, and scoliosis. This is the first clinical report of a microdeletion of chromosome 1p31.1 involving only the NEGR1 gene."},
